{
  "id": "P11",
  "format": "posting-scenario/v1",
  "name": "Customer receipt drafts: no effect until posted; a draft in a since-closed period is rejected, re-dated and posted; a stale proposal is rejected at post; draft → cancel",
  "rules": [
    "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED@1",
    "SALE_POSTED/service@1",
    "PERIOD_CLOSED@1",
    "REPORT/trial-balance@1"
  ],
  "source": "docs/posting-rules/customer-receipt.md",
  "governedBy": [
    "ADR-0005",
    "ADR-0006",
    "ADR-0012",
    "Product Owner 2026-09-28 (receipt drafts)",
    "customer-receipt.md §1.1 and ruling R-1"
  ],
  "executableFrom": "M3",
  "status": "Specified, hand-computed by the Accounting seat, 2026-09-28 (M3-000c). Not yet executed: needs customers, invoices, receipts and period close (M3).",
  "description": [
    "Today is 2026-10-05 (Asia/Karachi). FY2027 = 2026-07-01 … 2027-06-30, all periods OPEN at the start.",
    "",
    "Step 1 posts the P04 invoice: INV-A1, 2026-09-15, 10000.0000 to CUST-A.",
    "  JE-2027-000001  Dr 1200 [CUST-A] 10000.0000 / Cr 4200 10000.0000",
    "",
    "Steps 2–4 save three receipt drafts, all proposing allocations to INV-A1:",
    "  RCT-D1  BANK  6000.0000  dated 2026-09-20",
    "  RCT-D2  CASH  5000.0000  dated 2026-10-03",
    "  RCT-D3  BANK  4000.0000  dated 2026-10-04",
    "  Proposed total 15000.0000 > outstanding 10000.0000. All three save: proposals reserve nothing.",
    "",
    "Step 5, by hand: drafts have no effect of any kind.",
    "  Entries 1. INV-A1 outstanding 10000.0000. CUST-A ledger 10000.0000 Dr.",
    "  TB: 1200 10000.0000 Dr; 4200 10000.0000 Cr. No RCT number issued.",
    "",
    "Steps 6–8 close July, August and September in order (periods.md §4.1).",
    "",
    "Step 9 posts RCT-D1 as it stands, dated 2026-09-20: September is CLOSED, so PERIOD_CLOSED.",
    "  The draft stays DRAFT, unchanged, un-numbered. The system does not re-date it.",
    "Step 10: the user re-dates RCT-D1 to 2026-10-02 (a human choice, customer-receipt.md §1.1 rule 5).",
    "Step 11 posts it:",
    "  JE-2027-000002  2026-10-02  Dr 1120 6000.0000 / Cr 1200 [CUST-A] 6000.0000",
    "  RCT-2027-000001: the rejected post in step 9 consumed no number.",
    "  INV-A1 outstanding = 10000.0000 − 6000.0000 = 4000.0000.",
    "",
    "Step 12 posts RCT-D2: its proposal of 5000.0000 was within outstanding when saved (10000.0000)",
    "but is re-validated at post against 4000.0000. ALLOCATION_EXCEEDS_OUTSTANDING. Stays DRAFT.",
    "Step 13 cancels RCT-D2: CANCELLED, no number, no entry, one audit record.",
    "Step 14 tries to post the cancelled RCT-D2: RECEIPT_NOT_DRAFT.",
    "Step 15 tries to cancel the posted RCT-D1: RECEIPT_NOT_DRAFT (reverse it instead).",
    "Step 16 replays step 11 exactly: REPLAYED, the original entry and number.",
    "Step 17 cancels RCT-D3, which was never posted: the pure draft → cancel path.",
    "",
    "Step 18, by hand:",
    "  TB as of 2026-09-30 (September, closed): 1200 10000.0000 Dr; 4200 10000.0000 Cr;",
    "    Σ Dr 10000.0000 = Σ Cr 10000.0000. The receipt is in October, not September.",
    "  TB as of 2026-10-05: 1120 +6000.0000 = 6000.0000 Dr;",
    "                       1200 +10000.0000 − 6000.0000 = 4000.0000 Dr;",
    "                       4200 10000.0000 Cr;",
    "    Σ Dr 6000.0000 + 4000.0000 = 10000.0000 = Σ Cr 10000.0000.",
    "    1110 Cash in Hand has no activity: RCT-D2 (CASH) was never posted.",
    "  CUST-A ledger: 10000.0000 (JE-1, 2026-09-15) then 4000.0000 (JE-2, 2026-10-02).",
    "  Invariant 9 (AR half): GL 4000.0000; subledger 10000.0000 − 6000.0000 = 4000.0000; difference 0.0000.",
    "  Entries 2. RCT numbers issued: RCT-2027-000001 only. Two rejected posts and two cancellations consumed none."
  ],
  "fixture": {
    "coa": "standard-v1",
    "timezone": "Asia/Karachi",
    "fiscalYearStartMonth": 7,
    "today": "2026-10-05",
    "periods": { "fiscalYear": 2027, "status": "all OPEN" },
    "tenants": ["GOLDEN_A"],
    "customers": [{ "ref": "CUST-A", "tenant": "GOLDEN_A", "status": "ACTIVE" }],
    "draftInvoices": ["INV-A1"]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "SALE_POSTED",
      "referenceType": "sales_invoice",
      "referenceId": "INV-A1",
      "idempotencyKey": "p11-inv",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-15",
      "payload": {
        "settlement": "CREDIT",
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "lines": [
          {
            "kind": "SERVICE",
            "description": "Monthly maintenance",
            "quantity": "1.000000",
            "unitPrice": "7500.000000",
            "lineNet": "7500.0000"
          },
          {
            "kind": "SERVICE",
            "description": "Site visit",
            "quantity": "3.000000",
            "unitPrice": "833.333333",
            "lineNet": "2500.0000"
          }
        ],
        "netAmount": "10000.0000"
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000001",
        "documentNumber": "INV-2027-000001",
        "entriesAfter": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "do": "saveDraft",
      "documentType": "customer_receipt",
      "document": "RCT-D1",
      "fields": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "BANK",
        "receiptDate": "2026-09-20",
        "amount": "6000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "6000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "documentStatus": "DRAFT",
        "documentNumber": null,
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "6000.0000", "status": "PROPOSED" }],
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "entriesAfter": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "do": "saveDraft",
      "documentType": "customer_receipt",
      "document": "RCT-D2",
      "fields": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "CASH",
        "receiptDate": "2026-10-03",
        "amount": "5000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "5000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "documentStatus": "DRAFT",
        "documentNumber": null,
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "5000.0000", "status": "PROPOSED" }],
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "entriesAfter": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "do": "saveDraft",
      "documentType": "customer_receipt",
      "document": "RCT-D3",
      "$comment": "Proposals now total 6000.0000 + 5000.0000 + 4000.0000 = 15000.0000 against an outstanding of 10000.0000. Saving is still allowed: a proposal reserves nothing.",
      "fields": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "BANK",
        "receiptDate": "2026-10-04",
        "amount": "4000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "4000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "documentStatus": "DRAFT",
        "documentNumber": null,
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "4000.0000", "status": "PROPOSED" }],
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "entriesAfter": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "do": "assert",
      "$comment": "Three drafts, no effect: the books are exactly as after step 1.",
      "trialBalance": {
        "asOf": "2026-10-05",
        "rows": [
          { "account": "1200", "debit": "10000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "4200", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "10000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "10000.0000", "credit": "10000.0000" }
      },
      "customerLedger": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "from": "2026-07-01",
        "to": "2026-10-05",
        "openingBalance": "0.0000",
        "lines": [
          {
            "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000001",
            "document": "INV-2027-000001",
            "date": "2026-09-15",
            "debit": "10000.0000",
            "credit": "0.0000",
            "runningBalance": "10000.0000"
          }
        ],
        "closingBalance": "10000.0000"
      },
      "invoiceOutstanding": { "INV-A1": "10000.0000" },
      "invariant9": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "gl": "10000.0000",
        "subledger": "10000.0000",
        "difference": "0.0000"
      },
      "documentStatuses": { "RCT-D1": "DRAFT", "RCT-D2": "DRAFT", "RCT-D3": "DRAFT" },
      "documentNumbersIssued": { "INV": ["INV-2027-000001"], "RCT": [] },
      "journalEntryCount": 1
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "do": "period",
      "action": "close",
      "period": "2026-07",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "TRANSITIONED",
        "periodStatus": { "2026-07": "CLOSED" },
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "do": "period",
      "action": "close",
      "period": "2026-08",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "TRANSITIONED",
        "periodStatus": { "2026-08": "CLOSED" },
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "do": "period",
      "action": "close",
      "period": "2026-09",
      "$comment": "Close is not blocked by drafts dated in the period: the close checklist is deferred (periods.md §7), and a draft has no accounting effect to finalise.",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "TRANSITIONED",
        "periodStatus": { "2026-09": "CLOSED" },
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 9,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
      "referenceType": "customer_receipt",
      "referenceId": "RCT-D1",
      "idempotencyKey": "p11-d1-a",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-20",
      "$comment": "The draft as saved in step 2. Its period has closed since. Rejected at post; never re-dated by the system.",
      "payload": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "BANK",
        "amount": "6000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "6000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "REJECTED",
        "error": "PERIOD_CLOSED",
        "errorDetail": { "period": "2026-09", "currentOpenPeriod": "2026-10" },
        "documentStatus": "DRAFT",
        "documentNumber": null,
        "entriesAfter": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 10,
      "do": "editDraft",
      "documentType": "customer_receipt",
      "document": "RCT-D1",
      "$comment": "The user's choice (customer-receipt.md §1.1 rule 5, option a). 2026-10-02 is on or after the invoice date 2026-09-15, so row 6 still holds.",
      "fields": { "receiptDate": "2026-10-02" },
      "expect": {
        "documentStatus": "DRAFT",
        "documentNumber": null,
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "entriesAfter": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 11,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
      "referenceType": "customer_receipt",
      "referenceId": "RCT-D1",
      "idempotencyKey": "p11-d1-b",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-02",
      "payload": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "BANK",
        "amount": "6000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "6000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000002",
        "documentNumber": "RCT-2027-000001",
        "documentStatus": "POSTED",
        "period": "2026-10",
        "postingRule": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED@1",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1120", "debit": "6000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1200", "party": "CUST-A", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "6000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "6000.0000", "credit": "6000.0000" },
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "6000.0000", "status": "LIVE" }],
        "entriesAfter": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 12,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
      "referenceType": "customer_receipt",
      "referenceId": "RCT-D2",
      "idempotencyKey": "p11-d2-a",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-03",
      "$comment": "Valid when saved (5000.0000 ≤ 10000.0000). Re-validated at post against the current outstanding 4000.0000.",
      "payload": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "CASH",
        "amount": "5000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "5000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "REJECTED",
        "error": "ALLOCATION_EXCEEDS_OUTSTANDING",
        "errorDetail": {
          "invoice": "INV-A1",
          "outstanding": "4000.0000",
          "requested": "5000.0000"
        },
        "documentStatus": "DRAFT",
        "documentNumber": null,
        "entriesAfter": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 13,
      "do": "cancelDraft",
      "documentType": "customer_receipt",
      "document": "RCT-D2",
      "reason": "Customer paid by bank instead; recorded on the posted receipt",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "TRANSITIONED",
        "documentStatus": "CANCELLED",
        "documentNumber": null,
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "5000.0000", "status": "PROPOSED" }],
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "auditRecordsWritten": 1,
        "entriesAfter": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 14,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
      "referenceType": "customer_receipt",
      "referenceId": "RCT-D2",
      "idempotencyKey": "p11-d2-b",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-03",
      "payload": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "CASH",
        "amount": "4000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "4000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "REJECTED",
        "error": "RECEIPT_NOT_DRAFT",
        "errorDetail": { "status": "CANCELLED" },
        "documentStatus": "CANCELLED",
        "entriesAfter": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 15,
      "do": "cancelDraft",
      "documentType": "customer_receipt",
      "document": "RCT-D1",
      "reason": "Trying to cancel a posted receipt",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "REJECTED",
        "error": "RECEIPT_NOT_DRAFT",
        "errorDetail": { "status": "POSTED" },
        "documentStatus": "POSTED",
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "entriesAfter": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 16,
      "do": "post",
      "$comment": "Exact replay of step 11 (a network retry). The module's status check does not pre-empt it; the kernel returns the original.",
      "event": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
      "referenceType": "customer_receipt",
      "referenceId": "RCT-D1",
      "idempotencyKey": "p11-d1-b",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-02",
      "payload": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "BANK",
        "amount": "6000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "6000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "REPLAYED",
        "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000002",
        "documentNumber": "RCT-2027-000001",
        "entriesAfter": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 17,
      "do": "cancelDraft",
      "documentType": "customer_receipt",
      "document": "RCT-D3",
      "reason": "Entered in error",
      "$comment": "Draft → cancel with no post attempt. No GL effect, no number, no allocation effect.",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "TRANSITIONED",
        "documentStatus": "CANCELLED",
        "documentNumber": null,
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "4000.0000", "status": "PROPOSED" }],
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "auditRecordsWritten": 1,
        "entriesAfter": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 18,
      "do": "assert",
      "trialBalances": [
        {
          "asOf": "2026-09-30",
          "rows": [
            { "account": "1200", "debit": "10000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
            { "account": "4200", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "10000.0000" }
          ],
          "totals": { "debit": "10000.0000", "credit": "10000.0000" }
        },
        {
          "asOf": "2026-10-05",
          "rows": [
            { "account": "1120", "debit": "6000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
            { "account": "1200", "debit": "4000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
            { "account": "4200", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "10000.0000" }
          ],
          "totals": { "debit": "10000.0000", "credit": "10000.0000" }
        }
      ],
      "customerLedger": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "from": "2026-07-01",
        "to": "2026-10-05",
        "openingBalance": "0.0000",
        "lines": [
          {
            "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000001",
            "document": "INV-2027-000001",
            "date": "2026-09-15",
            "debit": "10000.0000",
            "credit": "0.0000",
            "runningBalance": "10000.0000"
          },
          {
            "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000002",
            "document": "RCT-2027-000001",
            "date": "2026-10-02",
            "debit": "0.0000",
            "credit": "6000.0000",
            "runningBalance": "4000.0000"
          }
        ],
        "closingBalance": "4000.0000"
      },
      "invoiceOutstanding": { "INV-A1": "4000.0000" },
      "invariant9": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "gl": "4000.0000",
        "subledger": "4000.0000",
        "difference": "0.0000"
      },
      "documentStatuses": { "RCT-D1": "POSTED", "RCT-D2": "CANCELLED", "RCT-D3": "CANCELLED" },
      "documentNumbersIssued": { "INV": ["INV-2027-000001"], "RCT": ["RCT-2027-000001"] },
      "journalEntryCount": 2,
      "roundingAccountBalance": "0.0000"
    }
  ]
}
